      "3. John Adair, ”The Art of Creative Thinking”, Kogan Page Publication, 2011\nEEE, NIT Goa Academic Handbook : B.Tech. in EEE 33/ 166\n\nModule 3. Fourth Semester Courses: 3.2. Signals and Systems",
