      "2. B P Lathi, ”Signal Processing and Linear Systems”, Oxford University Press, 1998\nEEE, NIT Goa Academic Handbook : B.Tech. in EEE 35/ 166\n\nModule 3. Fourth Semester Courses: 3.3. Electrical Machines - I",
