      "Module 5: Future Trends, Planning, and Economic Aspects of HVDC & FACTS: Planning & Eco-\nnomics: HVDC Vs. HVAC, Cost-Benefit Analysis, Investment & Policy Considerations. Emerging\nTechnologies: Superconducting DC, Wide-Area FACTS, Solid-State Transformers. Applications:\nHVDC for Large-Scale Renewables, FACTS for Smart Grids. India’s Renewable Grid Performance\nwith HVDC & FACTS.\n7.13.5"
