      "Module 5: Other Special Machines: Hysteresis Motors: Construction, Principle, Characteristics, Applica-\ntions. Repulsion Motors: Types, Working, Characteristics, Applications. Axial Flux and Transverse\nFlux Machines: Construction, Principle, Performance characteristics, Applications in EVs and wind\nturbines.\n7.20.5"
