      "3. William K. Pratt, “Digital Image Processing,” Wiley-Interscience, 2007 (4th Ed.)\nEEE, NIT Goa Academic Handbook : B.Tech. in EEE 129/ 166\n\nModule 7. Elective Courses: 7.31. FPGA based Digital Design",
