      "Module 3: Electrical system design and Smart Buildings: Electrical system design, estimation and cost-\ning for various buildings– domestic, commercial complex, hospitals, schools, cinema theatres, small\nindustries. Design of electrical installations of high-rise buildings: electrical aspects of lifts, escalator\nservices, stand by generators. Solar PV integration and renewable energy, Fire and shock hazard\nprevention, Green buildings, Net-zero and energy-positive buildings, Certifications & Policies.",
