      "3. Sung Mo Kang, Yusuf Leblebici, Chulwoo Kim “CMOS Digital Integrated Circuits- Analysis &\nDesigning”, MGH, 4th Edition, 2016.",
      "4. J Baker, CMOS: Circuit Design, Layout and Simulation, 2nd Edition, John Wiley & Sons, 2009.",
