      "Module 3: Local Area Networks (10 hours)\nLocal Area Networks: LAN topologies, access mechanisms and media, contention based LANS, Token\npassing LANS; Metropolitan Area Networks: Distributed Queue Dual Bus (DQDB), Fiber Distributed Data\nInterface (FDDI).\nInternet and Internet Protocol Suite: Internet, IPV4, IP addressing, ICMP, IPV6, Transport control protocol,\nUDP protocol suite.",
