      "Module 5: Graphs: Representation, adjacency list, graph traversals: DFS, BFS, and their\napplications; Minimum spanning tree: Kruskal’s, and Prim’s algorithms; Shortest Path\nProblem- Dijkstra’s, Bellman Ford, and Floyd-Warshall algorithms; algorithms on sorting:\nSelection sort, bubble sort, quick sort, merge sort, heap sort, searching: linear and binary\nsearch."
