      "7. Behrouz A. Forouzan and D. Mukhopadhyay, Cryptography & Network Security,\nMcGraw Hill, New Delhi. , 2nd Edition - 1st reprint 2010.\n\nCourse Objective\nThe objective of the course is to understand the implementation of an operating system. This\nis to develop sufficient skills in the learner to write a new operating system if needed for\ndeveloping systems to solve problems."
