      "Module 4\nSymbol table, syntax-directed translation schemes, intermediate code generation, translation\nschemes for programming language constructs, runtime storage allocation.",
      "Module 5\nCode generation and instruction selection: Issues, basic blocks and flow graphs, register\nallocation, DAG representation of programs, code generation from DAG, peep hole\noptimization, code generator generators, specifications of machine. Code optimization, source\n\nof optimizations, optimization of basic blocks, loops, global dataflow analysis, solution to\niterative dataflow equations."
