      "3. P. K. Nag, \"Engineering Thermodynamics,\" 3rd ed. Tata McGraw Hill, 2005.",
      "4. H. N. Shapiro and M. J. Moran, \"Fundamentals of Engineering Thermodynamics,\" 8th\ned. Wiley, 2014.",
