      "Crop Machinery: Machinery for crop harvesting design and operation, Root crop harvesting\nmachinery, Machinery for horticultural crops, Equipment for crop protection and disease\ncontrol\nAuxiliary Farm Machinery: Machinery for transport and material handling, Machinery for\nland drainage, reclamation and estate maintenance"
