      "/Text Material:",
      "1. W. Bolton, \"Mechatronics,\" Pearson Education Asia, 2004.",
      "2. D. G. Alciatore and M. B. Histand, \"Introduction to Mechatronics and Measurement\nSystems,\" McGraw Hill, 2007.",
