      "The course on Mechatronics aims to discuss its mechanics, electronics, and software. It equips\nthe student with the expertise to design, build, and control intelligent machines. It also aims to\nexplore sensors and actuators, digital electronics and signal conditioning, and also introduce\nPLC programming."
