      "Module 3 Abstractions from Precipitation: Evaporation and Evaporation Process,\nmeasurement, estimation and control of evaporation, Evapotranspiration, measurement and\nestimation of evapotranspiration, interception and depression storage, Infiltration process,\nmeasurement of infiltration, infiltration models and infiltration indices and effective rainfall.",
      "Module 4 Stream Flow Measurement: Methods of measurement of stream flow, stage-\ndischarge relationship, Runoff characteristics, catchment characteristics effecting the runoff,\nyield from a catchment, flow duration curve and flow mass curve.",
