      "1. Analysis of water distribution Networks, Bhave P R, Gupta R, Nawas Publishing Co,\nNew Delhi, 2006",
      "2. Optimal Design of Water Distribution Networks, Bhave P R, Nawas Publishing Co,\nNew Delhi, 2003\nReference books:",
