      "Module 2 Vibration control for SHM: Vibration Control using SHM, introduction to FE\nformulation, Constitutive Relationship, Element Stiffness Matrix for High Precision Finite\nElement analysis, Mass Matrix for High Precision Finite Element analysis, Developing\nActuator and Sensor Influence Matrix, Estimating Sensor Voltage, Active Control of Damping,\nSHM of Ribbon Reinforced Composite Laminate",
      "Module 3 SHM using piezo and magnetostrictive layers: Delamination Sensing using Piezo\nSensory Layer, Voltage Response from Piezopatch, Electrical Impedance Method: basic\ntheory, SHM using Magnetostrictive Sensory Layer, Basics of Magnetization and Hysteresis\nDelamination, Sensing using Magnetostrictive Sensory Layer, Constitutive relationship with\ncomposite relationship, MS Layer in symmetric Laminate, MS Layer Away from the Midplane\nin Asymmetric Laminate, Case Studies related to MS Layer based SHM.",
      "Module 4 SHM using Laser Doppler Vibrometers (LDV): Experimental Modal Analysis\nusing LDV - introduction, Velocity and Displacement Measurement using LDV, Case Studies"
